    echr:hasSupportingQuote "The case concerns the non-enforcement of judgments delivered by the Supreme Administrative Court following proceedings initiated by the applicant to annul decisions related to the valuation, tender invitation and subsequent sale of a television channel and radio station owned by joint-stock companies in which the applicant held shares."@en .

doc:proceeding_administrative_court_2011 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "On 24 February 2011, the applicant initiated proceedings before the administrative court, seeking the annulment of the sale of Viva TV-Radio Viva."@en ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2014-03-19"^^echr:PartialDate ;
    echr:hasOutcome echr:OutcomeClaimDismissed ;
